# =============================================================================
# HARDENING CHECKLIST (not config keys — operator reminders)
#   [ ] Secrets rendered by gen-secrets.sh, kept out of the image/VCS.
#   [ ] TLS cert is CA-signed for __DOMAIN__ (+ mail.__DOMAIN__), not self-signed.
#   [ ] DKIM TXT record published; SPF + DMARC records published.
#   [ ] DB user is scoped (see grant.sql) — NOT "ALL PRIVILEGES WITH GRANT".
#   [ ] Your real domains inserted into the Domains table (see domains.sql).
#   [ ] Hosts table row matches this machine's hostname.
#   [ ] MX + reverse DNS (PTR) for the mail host configured.
#   [ ] DIME org key/signet are a magmad-compatible pair. This tree's 'signet' CLI can emit
#       an incompatible signet; if magmad logs "Unable to parse the PRIME organizational
#       signing key", regenerate with gen-secrets.sh --dime-copy-from <known-good dir>.
# =============================================================================
